      "id": "D041-E01",
      "heading": "Completed export manifest",
      "text": "The manifest describes one completed export in ws-amber-lab. Each row names one attribute of the same job, not a new job. The selected interval is half-open: the start is included and the end is excluded. The row count describes exported measurements, not devices or source pages. A consumer should compare this record with its downloaded file before marking a local import complete.",
